  "ruleText": "Rev 1802.02 Withdrawal of Application. The landowner may withdraw Form PA-60 “Conservation Restriction Assessment Application” in the same year in which it was submitted, provided the municipality has not recorded the form with the county register of deeds.\n\nSource. #5231, eff 9-27-91; ss by #5353, eff 3-12-92; ss by #6692, eff 2-21-98; ss by #8567, eff 2-14-06; ss by #10560, eff 3-28-14; ss by #13867, eff 2-8-24",
